<title>USA: CFX Corp gets approvals for mergers.</title>
<headline>CFX Corp gets approvals for mergers.</headline>
<dateline>KEENE, N.H. 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>CFX Corp said on Thursday that it has received regulatory approvals for its mergers with Community Bankshares Inc and Portsmouth Bank Shares Inc.</p>
<p>Both transactions are scheduled to close on August 29, 1997, CFX said in a statement.</p>
<p>The final exchange ratio for the Portsmouth deal has been fixed at 0.9314 shares of CFX for each Portsmouth share, CFX said. The exchange ratio for the Community Bankshares deal will be set at closing, CFX said.</p>
</text>
